# Americium · Am · gate 95

**Americium** (Am) is element **95** of the periodic table — a **actinide**, period 7, group f-block, f-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **[243] (most stable isotope)**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
The radioactive speck inside every household smoke detector.

